---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: The Books
description: Every book in SEASONS by Tamica M. Roberson, in reading order. Start with Book One, free, then choose Xavier's Story or Marcus's Story.
permalink: /books/
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import cover with context %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The series</p>
    <h1>SEASONS</h1>
    <p class="lede">Imani’s story, from the summer she turns twenty to the life she builds after. Start with Book One, free. After that the story splits into two lives, released side by side.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight" aria-labelledby="start-here">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title" id="start-here">Start here</h2>
    <ol class="reading-order">
      {%- for b in books.pages %}
      <li class="book-card">
        <a class="book-card__cover" href="/books/{{ b.slug }}/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{{ cover(b) }}</a>
        <div class="book-card__text">
          <p class="book-card__step">{{ loop.index }}</p>
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ b.label }} · {{ b.season }}</p>
          <h3><a href="/books/{{ b.slug }}/">{{ b.title }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ b.blurb[0] }}</p>
          <p class="status">{{ b.status }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="choose">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Books Two to Eight</p>
      <h2 id="choose">Then choose a life, or read both</h2>
      <p>Both series release together, one season at a time. Titles are revealed with each release.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="series-cols">
      {%- for line in ["xavier", "marcus"] %}
      <div class="series series--{{ line }}">
        <h3>{{ books.lines[line].name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ books.lines[line].promise }}</p>
        <ul class="shelf">
          {%- for b in books.all | byLine(line) %}
          <li>{{ cover(b, "cover--mini") }}<span class="shelf__status">{{ b.status }}</span></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="notes">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2 class="section-title" id="notes">Content notes</h2>
    <p>SEASONS is a story about healing, and some of what Imani heals from is hard to read. Across the series you will find:</p>
    <ul class="notes">
      {%- for n in books.contentNotes %}
      <li>{{ n }}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="muted">Each book’s page will list its own notes as it releases.</p>
  </div>
</section>
